        "A5",
        "A6",
        "A10"
      ],
      "defect": "Applies any approval.id it recognizes in its ledger with no scope check, no current-status check, and no aud check on approval.state. Still enforces the mandatory policy gate, which is a separate check this defect does not claim to bypass."
